Error [E0958]: `core.fs.read()` cannot run at comptime — it performs I/O
  --> tests/ui/comptime_io_rejected.jet:4:20
    |
  4 | comptime DATA = fs.read("config.txt")
    |                    ^^^^
 Why: comptime is pure and deterministic; I/O functions are not
 Fix: use `embed_file("path")` or `embed_bytes("path")` for build-time file reads; other I/O must remain in runtime code

Error [E0107]: nothing named `DATA` exists here
  --> tests/ui/comptime_io_rejected.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     print(DATA)
    |           ^^^^
 Why: a name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: declare it first: `DATA @= ...`
